---
import IconBrain from "@/assets/icons/IconBrain.svg";
---

<div
  class="rounded-lg bg-white"
>
  <details>
    <summary class="block w-full cursor-pointer list-none select-none px-3 py-2.5">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm whitespace-nowrap">
          <IconBrain class="h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 zai-brain" aria-hidden="true" />
          <span class="zai-shimmer-text">正在思考</span>
        </span>
        <svg
          width="16"
          height="16"
          viewBox="0 0 16 16"
          fill="none"
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          class="zai-arrow size-4 opacity-40 transition-transform duration-200"
        >
          <path
            d="M6 4L10 8L6 12"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            stroke-width="1.33"
          />
        </svg>
      </div>
    </summary>
    <div class="space-y-2 px-3 pb-1 pt-3 text-sm">
      <p>用户问的是"为什么"，不是"是什么"——先搞清楚意图。</p>
      <p>这道题表面是数学，本质是一个图论问题……等等，不对。</p>
      <p>重新推导一遍，第三步有个隐含假设需要验证。</p>
      <p>找到了三篇相关论文，其中一篇结论和另两篇相反，先标记冲突。</p>
      <p>整理思路，准备输出——结构：背景 → 核心逻辑 → 反例 → 结论。</p>
    </div>
  </details>
</div>

<style>
  details[open] .zai-arrow {
    rotate: 90deg;
  }

  .zai-brain {
    animation: zai-pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .zai-shimmer-text {
    color: transparent;
    background: linear-gradient(
      110deg,
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 50%, transparent) 0%,
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 50%, transparent) 35%,
      black 50%,
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 50%, transparent) 65%,
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 50%, transparent) 100%
    );
    background-size: 200% 100%;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    animation: zai-shimmer-scan 4s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes zai-pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 0.4; }
    50% { opacity: 1; }
  }

  @keyframes zai-shimmer-scan {
    0% { background-position: 200% 0; }
    100% { background-position: -200% 0; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .zai-brain,
    .zai-shimmer-text {
      animation: none;
    }
    .zai-shimmer-text {
      color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 50%, transparent);
      background: none;
    }
  }
</style>